# Virtual Memory: Page Tables & TLB Translation

## 1. Page Table Fundamentals
- **Structure**: Multi-level radix trees (x86-64 uses 4–5 levels: PML4→PDP→PD→PT→page). Each level indexes 9 bits of the virtual address;

